#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad ka tirtirto dhammaan natiijooyinka Dekedda ilaa MAC ilaa IP nidaamka?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto natiijooyinka dhacay ee Dekedda ilaa MAC ilaa IP hadda?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad doonayso inaad nadiifiso hawlaha baaritaanka Mactrack ee kaydsan?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad ka tirtirto dhammaan natiijooyinka Isku-darka Dekedda ilaa MAC ilaa IP nidaamka?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto oo aad dib u abuurto dhammaan natiijooyinka Isku-darka Dekedda ilaa MAC ilaa IP ee nidaamka?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad soo dejiso oo aad soo geliso xogta kaydka IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI hadda?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Ma hubtaa inaad doonayso inaad hadda dib u dhisto liiska taariikhda baaritaanka adigoo ka duulaya natiijooyinka Port ilaa MAC ilaa IP ee kaydsan?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Dib u dhis oo falanqee qaybta ay ku jirto kormeerka dekedda ugu dambeeya, kaas oo ah toddobaadka hadda jira ee leh qaybo toddobaadle ah. Miis aan la qaybin si buuxda ayaa loo hagaajiyaa. Baaritaannada qorshaysan waa laga boodayaa inta tani socoto. Sii wad?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Hawshan dayactirka ah socodsii xilliga shaqada ka baxsan. Dib-u-dhisku wuxuu midba midka kale ka dambeeya nuqul ka sameeyaa taariikhda buuxda ee jadwallada dekedda (ciwaanka MAC), ciwaanka IP iyo 802.1x, waxayna qaadan kartaa saacado. Baaritaannada qorshaysan waa la dhaafaa, dayactirka xog-ururinta waa la sugaa, raadinta MAC, IP iyo 802.1x waxay muujinaysaa farriin dayactir ilaa ay ka dhammaato. U ogolow meel bannaan oo disk-ga ah nuqul labaad oo jadwal kasta iyo tusmooyinkiisa ah. Sii wad?"

