#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "The port, IP and 802.1x tables are being repartitioned, or a rebuild did not finish, so their history cannot be changed now. Try again when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php has finished."
msgstr "Miisaska port-ka, IP iyo 802.1x waa la dib-u-qaybinayaa, ama dib-u-dhis ma dhammaan, sidaas darteed taariikhdooda hadda lama beddeli karo. Mar kale isku day marka cli/upgrade_partitioning.php uu dhammaado."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching while its history tables are repartitioned. Results are incomplete until the partitioning has finished."
msgstr "MacTrack waxay ku jirtaa habka dayactirka ee raadinta cinwaanka IP, cinwaanka MAC iyo 802.1x inta miisaskeeda taariikhda dib loo qaybinayo. Natiijooyinku ma dhammaystirna ilaa qaybintu ka dhammaato."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching because the partitioning of its history tables did not finish. Results are incomplete. Run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php again to resume it."
msgstr "MacTrack waxay ku jirtaa habka dayactirka ee raadinta cinwaanka IP, cinwaanka MAC iyo 802.1x sababtoo ah qaybinta miisaskeeda taariikhda ma dhammaan. Natiijooyinku ma dhammaystirna. Mar kale socodsii cli/upgrade_partitioning.php si aad u sii waddo."

