#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Maamulka Kaydka Xogta"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Waxay ka tirtirtaa kaydka xogta xiriirrada Port ilaa MAC ilaa IP ee waqtigoodu dhacay.  Waxaa laga saaraa oo keliya diiwaannada waqtigoodu dhacay, iyadoo lagu saleynayo shuruudahaaga."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Cusbooneysii Kaydka Xogta MAC/OUI ee Soo-saaraha IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Shaqadani waxay soo dejin doontaa oo rakibi doontaa kaydka xogta OIU ee ugu dambeeyay ee laga helo bogga IEEE. Kaadh kasta oo isku xirka shabakadda ah (NIC) wuxuu leeyahay Cinwaan MAC ah. Cinwaanka MAC waxaa loo qaybin karaa laba qaybood. Qaybta hore ee Cinwaanka MAC waxay ka kooban tahay MAC-ga Soo-saaraha. MAC-ga Soo-saaraha wuxuu aqoonsadaa cidda samaysay qaybta. Tani waxay waxtar u yeelan doontaa baaritaanka degdegga ah ee aaladaha aan la oggolayn ee shabakaddaada ku jira."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Waxay ka tirtirtaa hawlaha baaritaanka Mactrack ee duugoobay oo suurtogal ah inay dhaceen liiska hoos u dhaca ee aad hesho marka aad wax ka beddelayso nooca qalabka."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Waxay ka tirtirtaa kaydka xogta <strong>DHAMMAAN</strong> xiriirrada Port ilaa MAC ilaa IP, dhammaan Cinwaannada IP, Kala duwanaanshaha IP, iyo VLAN-yada.  Adeeggani wuxuu ku fiican yahay marka aad rabto inaad bilowdo mar kale.  <strong>HALIS: Dhammaan xogtii hore waa la tirtiraa.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Waxay dib u dhisaysaa liiska taariikhaha baaritaanka iyadoo laga soo qaadanayo natiijooyinka Deked ilaa MAC ilaa IP ee kaydsan, iyadoo qayb kasta mar la akhrinayo. Baaritaannada iyo dayactirku waxay liiska ka dhigaan mid casri ah, markaa tan waxaa loo baahan yahay oo keliya ka dib marka natiijooyinka laga saaro meel ka baxsan dayactirka, tusaale ahaan tirtiridda aaladaha."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Eeg Xaaladda Qaybta"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Waxay muujinaysaa sida natiijooyinka Port ilaa MAC ilaa IP loo qaybiyay, cabbirka qaybta la isticmaalayo iyo sababta, iyo waxa ay qabatay dayactirkii ugu dambeeyay ee kaydka xogta."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Waxay dib u dhisaysaa oo falanqaynaysaa kaliya qaybta ay ku jirto kormeerka dekedda ugu dambeeya si dib loogu helo booska la tirtiray; qaybaha toddobaadlaha ah taasi waa toddobaadka hadda jira. Miisaska aan la qaybin si buuxda ayaa loo hagaajiyaa. Baaritaannada qorshaysan waa laga boodayaa ilaa ay dhammaato."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Dooro qaybo maalinle ah ama toddobaadle ah, ama jooji qaybinta, shaxaha dekedda (ciwaanka MAC), ciwaanka IP iyo 802.1x. Dib-u-dhisku wuxuu koobiyeeyaa taariikhda buuxda gadaasha; baaritaannada qorshaysan waa laga boodaa oo raadinta MAC, IP iyo 802.1x waxay muujisaa farriin dayactir inta lagu guda jiro."

